# ===== Local data area: files that are not intended to be made public are placed in this directory and will never be stored in the database =====
/local/

# ===== Research reports are LOCAL-ONLY and must never be committed =====
# Reports routinely contain personal holdings, position sizes and account balances,
# and this repository is public — once pushed, that data is in the git history
# permanently, even if the file is later deleted.
# Reports already tracked from the original project remain tracked; nothing NEW
# written under reports/ is ever committed. To share a report, hand the file over
# directly or produce an anonymised version — never via a commit.
reports/

